# Production parts for the multi-object 3MF plate deliverable,
# build/pip-ball-socket-head-plate.3mf (scripts/plate.sh, gate.sh --check).
#
# Head and base print SEPARATELY (PIP joint + M4 foot). A single STL of both
# imports into the slicer as ONE fused body and prints welded. The plate packs
# them as N distinct objects; the assembled render stays a preview.
#
# A subset of ci.parts: the coupon is NOT a plate part.
head
base
